l stack.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/EdgeDepthFirstSearch","title":"EdgeDepthFirstSearch","url":"\/documentation\/traversal\/edgedepthfirstsearch","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EdgeDepthFirstSearch","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EdgeDepthFirstSearch","kind":"identifier"}]}}}